      "writtenOn": "2023-03-08T22:34:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ConnectFixedChnl will call l2cu_initialize_fixed_ccb() if needed, but will also try to connect to the peer device if we are not connected. So it is used if we want to _send_ a packet.\n\nBut to receive a packet, the stack will still call `l2cu_initialize_fixed_ccb` on an incoming packet, and obviously does not need to try to connect to the peer.",
